stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW
    NEW --> QUEUED: Source registered and analysis requested
    QUEUED --> INGESTING: Worker claims job
    INGESTING --> ANALYZING: Sources indexed
    ANALYZING --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: Eleven artifacts persisted
    REVIEW_REQUIRED --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: Edit and version review
    REVIEW_REQUIRED --> RESUMING: Explicit human decision
    RESUMING --> READY_FOR_SALES: All versions approved and ERP acknowledges
    RESUMING --> CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED: ERP acknowledges clarification
    CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED --> QUEUED: New evidence and new run
    READY_FOR_SALES --> QUEUED: New analysis preserves prior run
    INGESTING --> FAILED: Parser or storage error
    ANALYZING --> FAILED: Retrieval or model error
    RESUMING --> FAILED: ERP action not acknowledged
    FAILED --> QUEUED: Retry analysis checkpoint
    FAILED --> RESUMING: Retry approved outcome
